    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2ce49ab851197ee043b4ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花赏结束后・至宝尚远",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ef2d8f458ef262cffc773e3bd61bb5e358ec0cdab30b271aaeddffdbf1f4bdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd4be0f167359dcc0d9aece",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥听闻伏特加要变更路线，\n觉得她这样“很逊”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a365680860eac1e7c002208ecd51bb7987611de306d60b801c9713ab5c15898a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da50cc271fcec2e3599d66ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加则反驳\n是要贯彻自己心中的“帅气”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2d34771138da0345810013df3e2773eb0054d92407d290f76c236bb0df6889f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5c616919ded44d227218c1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时反问大和赤骥，\n她心目中的“第一”究竟是什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "232b1eadc0950bee03cac7bfaac41f4a4e0e08de442a5987267552f88c748755",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24628b9a9591202e8c668966",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的第一",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c30c217b26ad636b771bff3331ca91ab86eb5e6aee97252da4b694775c4c11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:595e58ad4775eee9c967241e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟伏特加大吵一架后，\n大和赤骥的状况不佳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2935c7180a61abccc2dd27ff2c16c07811352e9c365360246699bd00c5885da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836daae4dce34f1df4a5e2e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "选择参加“橡树大赛”",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab7bb55c44c6820abe9f37eed4c66fb3e77a92663ee59f30cb07f75b047e2add",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:543bd35bb3da12c3d7357cee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "选择参加“日本德比”",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9e46f1ced7633f777078229f87f4a3730b9e79031fe27c19fc7594b21486f29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6ed741a1577213eed218f45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她奔跑的样子宛如映照出自身的迷惘。\n看着她踌躇不前的模样，\n身为训练员的我决定──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a359beaf79ad41a548b4db2a361f6e8cbc8e34f0fdb8252eb8b0d00509f7eb12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58f3f410c0dfb36390f47a75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让大和赤骥跑完\n自己决定贯彻的后冠路线，\n我着手准备“橡树大赛”的参赛事宜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d50db8c4916b90b5ef8fb9a4e6d3c9d138f9e0e9f033f6980cfa719605ae708",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8268d4af39bda0bc2e4f95d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我决定准备让她参加“日本德比”，\n与伏特加正面对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15125a7d97fb43492817250c78a6a32fec1dbb6520321c944198c2ef1156fbab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374f261440d79d311e66c443",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那家伙的存在",
      "source_fingerprint": "61bb7181c15633a44b11f84a8874915e1a885fb9523108e21de81cc295bb5756",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4064d3815875c351ecca7bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥偶然听到伏特加\n对“日本德比”的热切意志──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b33369d06f1c2e00048bab284de196633eac3f7ac283ddf5435f1301adcd5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c45430b081828da91be936",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她再次下定决心，\n要赢过伏特加成为“第一”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82b24dc070ce9a17a1201841f8dc46add683228b0aa0a12173ef266fc17a38bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009414.json",
      "json_path": [
