      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加表示希望在“伊丽莎白女王杯”\n与她再次较量──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4e6f8648835252a86c14d2aec7ad5888b2754a99083346af571ad1fe8cd5159",
