      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥答应了这个提议，\n并表示下次也一定会赢后目送伏特加离开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13cb9f0633de54799b1d2aca8f6c7973652d83cb759ecd8aa4f860fb86aef543",
